# One directory per line. Fetched by chain/scripts/bootstrap.sh with `git sparse-checkout set --cone`,
# which also brings every file at the repo root (package.json, pnpm-workspace.yaml, pnpm-lock.yaml, .npmrc:
# the quickstart's account-setup container runs `pnpm install --filter linea-monorepo --filter contracts...`).
# patches/    -> pnpm patchedDependencies referenced by the root lockfile
# prover/prover-assets/ -> bind-mounted into the prover container (kzgsrs etc.); even dev mode stats the directory
# ts-libs/    -> workspace packages that contracts/ depends on
# contracts/  -> bind-mounted by the quickstart's deploy container (L1 rollup + L2 message service)
# docker/     -> compose specs + docker/config/* (genesis templates, prover, coordinator)
# scripts/    -> shared helper scripts referenced by the quickstart
# docs/getting-started/lineth-stack -> the quickstart itself (docker-compose.yml, versions.env, scripts/start.sh)
contracts
patches
prover/prover-assets
ts-libs
docker
